{
  "task_id": "sentiment-prompt-comparison",
  "name": "rusSocial sentiment — 5-model comparison",
  "version": "2026-05-08",
  "id_field": "post_id",
  "instructions": "Hand-label the sentiment of each post on a 3-class scale (negative / neutral / positive) using EVENT-VALENCE convention: 'cafe burned down' = NEGATIVE (bad event); 'official detained' = NEUTRAL unless framed as anti-corruption justice (then positive); 'sports victory' = POSITIVE; 'ad' = NEUTRAL. The yellow-highlighted chips show what each model said — five columns: tiny (small RuBERT), seara_base (large RuBERT), haiku_A (voice/tone prompt), haiku_B (event-valence prompt), haiku_C (audience-reaction prompt). Disagreement-flagged rows are pink-tinted.",
  "display": [
    {"field": "stratum_label", "label": "Stratum", "format": "tag"},
    {"field": "year_month", "label": "Year-month", "format": "compact"},
    {"field": "source", "label": "Source", "format": "compact"},
    {"field": "source_subtype", "label": "Channel type", "format": "compact"},
    {"field": "regionid", "label": "regionid", "format": "compact"},
    {"field": "text", "label": "Post text (RU)", "format": "longtext"},
    {"field": "tiny",       "label": "tiny",       "format": "tone", "highlight": "llm"},
    {"field": "seara_base", "label": "seara_base", "format": "tone", "highlight": "llm"},
    {"field": "haiku_A",    "label": "haiku-voice",     "format": "tone", "highlight": "llm"},
    {"field": "haiku_B",    "label": "haiku-event",     "format": "tone", "highlight": "llm"},
    {"field": "haiku_C",    "label": "haiku-audience",  "format": "tone", "highlight": "llm"},
    {"field": "post_id",    "label": "post_id", "format": "compact"}
  ],
  "row_class_field": "row_class",
  "row_class_map": {"disagreement": "fn-candidate"},
  "validation": [
    {
      "field": "verdict",
      "label": "Sentiment (event-valence convention)",
      "type": "enum",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        {"value": "negative", "label": "Negative", "key": "1", "tone": "bad"},
        {"value": "neutral",  "label": "Neutral",  "key": "2", "tone": "neutral"},
        {"value": "positive", "label": "Positive", "key": "3", "tone": "good"},
        {"value": "SKIP",     "label": "SKIP — can't tell", "key": "4", "tone": "warn"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "verdict_alt_voice",
      "label": "Alt: voice-only label (optional)",
      "type": "enum",
      "required": false,
      "options": [
        {"value": "negative", "label": "Neg-voice", "key": "q", "tone": "bad"},
        {"value": "neutral",  "label": "Neu-voice", "key": "w", "tone": "neutral"},
        {"value": "positive", "label": "Pos-voice", "key": "e", "tone": "good"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "notes",
      "label": "Notes",
      "type": "textarea",
      "placeholder": "Free text — interesting cases, sarcasm flags, anything"
    }
  ]
}
